it above N-1 is set. When subtraction fits and produces no\nborrow, set quotient[i] and replace the high residual slice with the\ndifference; otherwise leave the residual unchanged. Preserve the low\ni residual bits. At i=0 the residual is the unsigned remainder.\n\nBuild each active subtractor from bit generate g=(~x)&y and propagate\np=~(x^y), with borrow-in zero. Combine (g,p) through a balanced prefix\ntree, preferably with four-bit local groups and a balanced group tree,\nto compute every bit's borrow and the final borrow without a serial\nfull-width carry chain. Difference bits are x^y^borrow_in. Both the\nquotient decision and the selected residual must use these lookahead\nresults; computing a separate ripple subtraction would retain the\nbottleneck. C\n…[56791 of 59863 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:d758b49a7feea15a]…\nons and run strict real/ALTOPS lint, arithmetic/decoder/pipeline suites, unchanged single-channel formal, retirement cosim, canonical stalled CoreMark and all vendor placement options. Preserve nret=1 and exact external IO, default-illegal decode, all traps, precise RVFI operands/results/PCs, consecutive orders, progress, memory bounds, canonical CRCs, completion text and start/stop markers. Change only the listed allowed RTL and cocotb test.\n  notes: \nhyp-20261005-002-r13s1 structural regression fitness 189.69 MHz 75.478 cycles 3978917 title: Decouple fetch from backend holds with a two-entry fall-through queue\n  path: cpu/u_if/occupancy_q_0_s0 -> cpu/u_id/reg_q.rs1_val_3_s0 ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_if', 'cpu/u_rf', 'cpu/u_id']\nhyp-20261005-003-r13s2 predictor regression fitness 180.11 MHz 75.595 cycles 4197188 title: Separate bimodal direction history from tagged target maintenance\n  path: cpu/u_id/reg_q.rs2_val_0_s0 -> cpu/u_ex/u_alu/mul_product_65_s1 ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_ex', 'cpu/u_predictor', 'cpu/u_id']\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
