 u_ex/u_alu. The four combinational DIV/REM\\nexpressions are the strongest suspect: synthesized long division can\\nplace a carry/borrow chain followed by a remainder-selection mux in each\\nsuccessive quotient-bit step. Accelerating this local arithmetic path\\nshould improve CoreMark iterations/second without reducing iterations\\nper cycle. No LESSONS.md exists and log.jsonl contains\n…[130812 of 133884 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:d38198a72a46e6e2]…\n\\nwith the same local row in all four banks, then verify all targets\\nindependently. Exercise first/last rows, bank boundaries, conflicts\\nseparated by 0x100, same-edge lookup/replacement across banks, and\\nreset winning over a pending write. Retain zero-target miss checks.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 124.96, \"delta_pct\": -1.19, \"vs_baseline\": 931.02, \"fmax_mhz\": 52.451, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4197447, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3528, \"ff\": 925, \"seeds\": [49.656, 52.451, 52.451], \"perturbations\": [[0, 49.656, 14], [1, 52.451, 14], [2, 52.451, 14]], \"lutram\": 60, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.rs1_addr_0_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_3_dmem_3_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -15.139, \"arrival_ns\": 25.433, \"logic_cells\": 17, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_fwd\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 14, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T02:33:51.914096Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 4}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
