{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_58","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json,yaml,jsonschema,statistics\np=Path('cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261005-001-r8s0.yaml')\nd=yaml.safe_load(p.read_text())\nprobe=Path('/srv/hwebench/tmp/3d673a88/3690d99c/r8s0_probe/branch_factor')\nresults=[json.loads((probe/f'timing_p{i}.json').read_text()) for i in (0,1,2)]\nseeds=[r['fmax_mhz'] for r in results];median=statistics.median(seeds)\ncm=json.loads((probe/'cosim-results.json').read_text())\ncycles=cm['coremark']['bench_stop_cycle']-cm['coremark']['bench_start_cycle']\nfitness=median*1e6*10/cycles;delta=(fitness/194.25-1)*100\nold='''An isolated implementation of this exact factored topology measures 83.438 MHz on Gowin placement option one, versus a freshly reproduced 81.537 MHz champion on that same option. Resources are 4715 logic cells, 1857 registers, 32 LUT-RAM units, five BSRAMs and two DSPs. The gain is 2.33 percent in this single placement; it is not a scored median or an accepted champion replacement. Predict an integer two percent fitness gain with medium confidence pending full validation. At unchanged cycles median Fmax must exceed approximately 85.29 MHz and fitness must exceed 203.1855 iter/sec to clear the required 4.6 percent gate. Smaller gains must not be accepted.'''\nnew=f'''An isolated implementation of this exact factored topology measures Gowin placement options 0/1/2 at {seeds[0]:.3f}, {seeds[1]:.3f} and {seeds[2]:.3f} MHz, median {median:.3f} MHz. A freshly reproduced unchanged champion measures 81.537 MHz on option one. Resources are 4715 logic cells, 1857 registers, 32 LUT-RAM units, five BSRAMs and two DSPs. Strict real/ALTOPS lint, all 34 existing pipeline cocotb cases and all eight unchanged retirement cosim runs pass. An unrestricted combinational SAT miter proves equivalence for every pair of 32-bit operands and all eight branch_op encodings, including both 