{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_55","type":"agent_message","text":"Retaining every invalid control field preserves correctness but worsens timing. I’m narrowing the split: keep clearing side-effect controls, while allowing payload registers to capture speculative data independently of flush and fetch-valid signals. This should remove those signals from operand capture without adding validity gates to memory or hazard logic."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_56","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"mkdir -p cores/bench/generated/r8s1_speculative; python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport shutil\nrtl=Path('cores/bench/generated/r8s1_speculative/rtl');rtl.mkdir(exist_ok=True)\nfor p in Path('cores/bench/rtl').glob('*.sv'):shutil.copy2(p,rtl/p.name)\np=rtl/'if_stage.sv';s=p.read_text();s=s.replace(\\\"out.instr = flush ? 32'h0000_0013 : imem_data;\\\",'out.instr = imem_data;');p.write_text(s)\np=rtl/'id_stage.sv';s=p.read_text()\na=s.index('  always_ff @(posedge clock) begin');z=s.index('\\\\n  assign out = reg_q;',a)\nold=s[a:z]\nbody=old[old.index('      reg_q.pc       <= in.pc;'):old.index('    end\\\\n  end')]\nbody=body.replace('      reg_q.ctrl     <= ctrl_decoded;\\\\n','').replace('      reg_q.valid    <= in.valid;\\\\n','')\nnew='''  always_ff @(posedge clock) begin\n    if (reset) begin\n      reg_q <= '0;\n    end else begin\n      if (flush || (\"'!stall && !in.valid)) begin\n        reg_q.valid <= 1'\"'b0;\n        reg_q.ctrl <= '0;\n      end else if (\"'!stall) begin\n        reg_q.valid <= in.valid;\n        reg_q.ctrl <= ctrl_decoded;\n      end\n      if (!stall) begin\n'\"'''+body+'''      end\n    end\n  end\n'''\ns=s[:a]+new+s[z:];p.write_text(s)\nPY\nmake lint TARGET=bench RTL_DIR=cores/bench/generated/r8s1_speculative/rtl\nRTL_DIR=cores/bench/generated/r8s1_speculative/rtl OBJ_DIR=cores/bench/generated/r8s1_speculative/obj_dir NRET=1 bash test/cosim/build.sh > cores/bench/generated/r8s1_speculative/cosim_build.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
