{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_30","type":"agent_message","text":"The profile shows limited room for accuracy gains: the baseline replay has about 62,500 misses across 4.2 million benchmark cycles, and the proposed small local-history table removes only about 1,900. I’m revising the hypothesis toward predictor timing: preserve all 64 entries and their prediction policy, but use explicit flop rows with parallel tag matching and a balanced target-selection tree."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_31","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport shutil\nroot=Path.cwd()\np=root/'cores/bench/generated/predictor_research/parallel_btb'\nrtl=p/'rtl'\nshutil.copytree(root/'cores/bench/rtl',rtl,dirs_exist_ok=True)\n(rtl/'branch_predictor.sv').write_text('''// Constant-row flop predictor with direct-mapped parallel hit detection.\nmodule branch_predictor (\n  input logic clock, reset,\n  input logic [31:0] lookup_pc,\n  output logic predicted_taken,\n  output logic [31:0] predicted_target,\n  input logic update_en,\n  input logic [31:0] update_pc,\n  input logic update_branch, update_jump, update_legal, update_taken,\n  input logic [31:0] update_target\n);\n  wire lookup_range = lookup_pc[31:20] == 0 && lookup_pc[1:0] == 0;\n  wire update_range = update_pc[31:20] == 0 && update_pc[1:0] == 0;\n  wire target_range = update_target[31:20] == 0 && update_target[1:0] == 0;\n  wire allocate = update_legal && (update_branch || update_jump) && target_range;\n  wire [18:0] tree [1:127];\n  for (genvar i=0;i<64;i++) begin : g_row\n    localparam logic [5:0] INDEX = 6'(i);\n    logic valid_q;\n    logic [11:0] tag_q;\n    logic [17:0] target_q;\n    logic [1:0] counter_q;\n    logic jump_q;\n    wire lookup_hit = lookup_range && lookup_pc[7:2] == INDEX\n                    && valid_q && tag_q == lookup_pc[19:8];\n    wire update_index = update_range && update_pc[7:2] == INDEX;\n    wire update_hit = valid_q && tag_q == update_pc[19:8];\n    logic [1:0] next_counter;\n    always_comb begin\n      next_counter = update_taken ? 2'b10 : 2'b01;\n      if (update_hit && \"'!jump_q) begin\n        next_counter = counter_q;\n        if (update_taken && counter_q != 2'\"'b11) next_counter = counter_q + 2'b01;\n        else if (\"'!update_taken && counter_q != 2'\"'b00) next_counter = counter_q - 2'b01;\n      end\n    end\n    always_ff @(posedge clock) begin\n      if (reset) valid_q <= 1'b0;\n      else if (update_en && update_index) begin\n        if (allocate) begin\n          valid_q <= 1'b1;\n          tag_q <= update_pc[19:8];\n          target_q <= update_target[19:2];\n          counter_q <= update_jump ? 2'b10 : next_counter;\n          jump_q <= update_jump;\n        end else if (update_hit) valid_q <= 1'b0;\n      end\n    end\n    assign tree[64+i] = {lookup_hit && (jump_q || counter_q[1]),\n                        target_q & {18{lookup_hit}}};\n  end\n  for (genvar i=1;i<64;i++) begin : g_tree\n    assign tree[i] = tree[2*i] | tree[2*i+1];\n  end\n  assign predicted_taken = tree[1][18];\n  assign predicted_target = {12'b0,tree[1][17:0],2'b0};\nendmodule\n''')\nprint('Wrote isolated parallel-BTB prototype; champion RTL remains unchanged')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
